    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'This example shows an incredibly simple way to allow the player to override
    the size and positioning of the Ultimate Button.


    After clicking the Start
    button above, notice how the button stops resoponding to your input, but instead
    moves the button around the screen.


    Clicking the Stop button will return
    the button back to normal interaction. Note too that the override that you set
    will continue to be used even when playing the scene again!'
